# The Windows tray recorder. It is a Rust/Tauri app that talks to this
# deployment over HTTP; none of it is part of the site, and its build output
# runs to hundreds of megabytes.
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing: an unanchored "desktop" matches any
# directory of that name at any depth, which silently swallowed
# src/app/api/desktop and 404'd the endpoint the recorder signs in through.
/desktop

# The recorder's installer, kept at the top of the repo so it is easy to find
# and easy to hand to a machine. It is not part of the site.
Install Omni Recorder.exe
